---
layout: base.njk
title: The Wire
dek: What the region reported today, credited and linked. Not our reporting — theirs.
permalink: /wire/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="shell page">

  <div class="hero">
    <div>
      <div class="chip">The Wire</div>
      <h1 class="hero__title">What the region reported today, credited and linked</h1>
      <p class="hero__dek">Not our reporting — theirs. Short summaries of what other newsrooms broke across the Pacific, each one naming the outlet that did the work and linking straight to it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rail" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="rail__stack">
        <div class="rail__label">Updated {{ build.date | readableDate }}</div>
        <div class="rail__line"></div>
        <div class="rail__sub">Credit where it is due</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rail__word">wire</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cols">
    <div class="cols__main">

      {% for day in wire.days %}
      <section style="margin-bottom:clamp(30px,3.2vw,46px)">
        <h2 class="rule-head">{{ day.label }}</h2>
        <div class="wire">
          {% for it in day.items %}
          <article class="wire__item">
            <div class="wire__stamp">
              <div class="wire__time">{{ it.time }}</div>
              <div class="wire__place">{{ it.place }}</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              {% if it.section %}<div class="kicker" style="margin-bottom:7px"><a href="/{{ it.section | slugify }}/" style="color:var(--terra-dark)">{{ it.section }}</a></div>{% endif %}
              <h3 class="wire__title">{{ it.title }}</h3>
              <p class="wire__summary">{{ it.summary }}</p>
              <div class="wire__links">
                <a href="{{ it.url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="wire__via">Read it at {{ it.source }} &rarr;</a>
                {% if it.oursHref %}
                <a href="{{ it.oursHref }}" class="wire__ours">Our explainer: {{ it.oursLabel }}</a>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>
      {% endfor %}

      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="/subscribe/" class="btn">Get it by email</a>
        <a href="/feed.xml" class="btn btn--ghost">Subscribe by RSS</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="cols__aside">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="kicker kicker--light" style="margin-bottom:14px">What The Wire is</div>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-dark-bg);margin-bottom:14px">Every item here was reported by someone else. We read the region's newsrooms each morning, summarise what matters for a Pacific reader, and send you to the original.</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--bege-areia)">Our own reporting carries a Vox Meridian byline and never appears in this feed.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="rule-head">Who we read</h2>
        <div class="bureaus" style="margin-top:4px">
          {% for o in outlets %}
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline)">
            <a href="{{ o.url }}" rel="noopener" style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--esmeralda);border-bottom:1px solid var(--terra-dark)">{{ o.name }}</a>
            <span class="sidelist__meta" style="margin:0">{{ o.beat }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="rule-head">Our own work</h2>
        <div class="sidelist">
          {% for ex in collections.explainers %}
            {% if loop.index0 < 3 %}
            <a href="{{ ex.url }}">
              <div class="kicker" style="margin-bottom:6px">Explainer No. {{ ex.data.number }}</div>
              <div class="sidelist__title">{{ ex.data.title }}</div>
            </a>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

</div>
